# lessons

Historical record of every lesson learned, oldest to newest. Flat chronological by `## YYYY-MM-DD` headers. Search by date or topic for the rationale behind a rule in `Rules-of-Engagement.md`.

## Format

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD

### Rule: <headline>

<the full story: what happened, what was tried, what the fix was, why it matters>
```

Add the active, one-line form of every new rule to `Rules-of-Engagement.md` in the same pass.
